  "historyNote": "#5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; amd by #7207-B, eff 2-26-00; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; amd by #7578, eff 10-13-01; amd by #8714, INTERIM, eff 9-5-06, EXPIRES: 3-4-07; amd by #8790, eff 1-5-07; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12347, eff 8-14-17 (formerly Env-Hw 507.03); ss by #14280, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35 (formerly Env-Hw 507.04)",
